        "id": "mobile_form_a",
        "title": "Work phone check",
        "brief": "Ten items from a Tarrowby Logistics work phone: texts, printed notices with QR codes, and emails. Tarrowby's own sites end in tarrowby.example. For each one, choose Trust, Report, Delete or Verify (check with the sender on a number or app you already use), then tick what you noticed. You'll see how you did at the end. Reporting when you're unsure is always fine and never marked down, though a real one does take a colleague's time to check.",
